We need to produce a solution in Rust 1.56. The solution should read input, parse, compute maximum subarray sum.

Edge cases: all negative numbers: maximum sum is the largest (least negative) number. So algorithm: iterate, maintain current sum, max sum. current sum = max(current sum + x, x). max sum = max(max sum, current sum). Initialize current sum and max sum to first element.

